  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WOMEN IN WATER AND NATURAL RESOURCES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WWANC seeks to  engage women to enhance landscape restoration through tree growing in natural forests and farmlands and increase climate adaptive capacity for grassroot women and youths from Masai Mau forest catchment communities. This effort will result into a re-greened Masai Mau Forest, restored biodiversity, restored water and soil quality and quantity leading to food security and improved quality of life, improved livelihood, increased women and youth participation Mau restoration activities.</narrative>
  </description>
